{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "接入一条新链",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 90.22,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "放到一个具体场景里。交易所要接入一条新链。",
   "spoken": "放到一个具体场景里。交易所要接入一条新链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.572
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "照搬以太坊的接入逻辑，是假充值、错账和资金丢失的主要来源。",
   "spoken": "照搬以太坊的接入逻辑，是假充值、错账和资金丢失的主要来源。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 5.98,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 6.078,
   "speechEnd": 11.396
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "接入的人，先问这几件事。",
   "spoken": "接入的人，先问这几件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 11.8,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 11.89,
   "speechEnd": 13.871
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "失败的交易会不会上链，实际到账金额怎么读。",
   "spoken": "失败的交易会不会上链，实际到账金额怎么读。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 14.26,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 14.26,
   "speechEnd": 18.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "代币由什么唯一标识，合约地址、mint 地址、对象类型，还是 denom。有没有同名假币。",
   "spoken": "代币由什么唯一标识，合约地址、mint 地址、对象类型，还是 denom。有没有同名假币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 18.96,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 19.063,
   "speechEnd": 26.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "多少个区块之后不可回滚，历史上有没有停链。",
   "spoken": "多少个区块之后不可回滚，历史上有没有停链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 27.34,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 27.443,
   "speechEnd": 31.208
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "有没有两个独立运营的节点。现有的 HSM 和 MPC，支不支持这条链的签名算法。",
   "spoken": "有没有两个独立运营的节点。现有的 HSM 和 MPC，支不支持这条链的签名算法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 31.64,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 31.64,
   "speechEnd": 39.599
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "资产是否依赖链下索引器，用哪个版本，多个索引器的结果是否一致。",
   "spoken": "资产是否依赖链下索引器，用哪个版本，多个索引器的结果是否一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 40.02,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 40.02,
   "speechEnd": 45.527
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "链官方的 SDK 也是供应链。签名服务不要和业务代码共用依赖。",
   "spoken": "链官方的 SDK 也是公应链。签名服务不要和业务代码共用依赖。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 46.0,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 46.092,
   "speechEnd": 51.209
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "普通用户，跨链前确认代币的唯一标识，不只看名称。在 Solana 上签名时，看到陌生程序，不签。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，跨链前确认代币的唯一标识，不只看名称。在 Solana 上签名时，看到陌生程序，不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 51.66,
   "dur": 8.48,
   "speechStart": 51.66,
   "speechEnd": 59.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。Solana 程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。Solana 程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 60.36,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 60.36,
   "speechEnd": 64.847
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "由调用者在交易里传进来。所以程序必须自己核对每个账户的 owner、类型和地址。",
   "spoken": "由掉用者在交易里传进来。所以程序必须自己核对每个账户的 owner、类型和地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 65.58,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 65.673,
   "speechEnd": 72.985
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "这个答案只对 Solana 成立。换一条链，输入换了样子。",
   "spoken": "这个答案只对 Solana 成立。换一条链，输入换了样子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 73.4,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 73.4,
   "speechEnd": 77.95
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "要问的仍是同一个问题，谁决定这个输入可信。",
   "spoken": "要问的仍是同一个问题，谁决定这个输入可信。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 78.34,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 78.435,
   "speechEnd": 82.596
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "换一种账户模型，就换一组漏洞。",
   "spoken": "换一种账户模型，就换一组漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg6-14.wav",
   "start": 83.04,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 83.04,
   "speechEnd": 85.386
  },
  {
